---
// Home hero. The full section, with install and actions, lands in Phase 4.
---

<section class="hero">
	<h1 class="hero__title">Secure by default.<br /><span class="hero__accent">Fast by design.</span></h1>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		box-sizing: border-box;
		max-width: var(--dy-width-content);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: var(--dy-space-28) var(--dy-space-8) var(--dy-space-26);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.hero__title {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--dy-text-display-hero);
		font-weight: var(--dy-weight-extrabold);
		line-height: var(--dy-leading-display);
		letter-spacing: var(--dy-tracking-display);
	}

	.hero__accent {
		color: var(--dy-color-accent);
	}
</style>
